<title>UK: SOCCER-SUNDERLAND TO PLAY AJAX AT NEW STADIUM.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SUNDERLAND TO PLAY AJAX AT NEW STADIUM.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>English premier league club Sunderland said on Tuesday they would play Ajax Amsterdam on July 30 to mark the opening of their new 42,000-seater stadium.</p>
<p>Sunderland are moving from Roker Park, their home since 1898.</p>
